**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.git

# Runtime state, at any depth. The bare `data` / `*.sqlite*` these replace only
# matched the context root, so backend/data -- 265 MB of local dev catalog and
# parquet lake -- was being copied into every image by `COPY backend/`. It never
# affected the running app (DATAQ_DATA_DIR points elsewhere), which is exactly
# why it went unnoticed. Nothing tracked by git lives in a `data/` directory.
data
**/data
**/data_old*
sample-data
**/*.duckdb
**/*.sqlite*

# Exported conversation transcripts: large, and possibly sensitive. `railway up`
# uploads the build context, so keep them out of it.
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt
.env
plans/
docs/
data-from-railway
dataq-data*.tgz
